.TH CTHRPOOL_FUTURE_CANCELLED 3 "2026-08-02" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cthrpool_future_cancelled \- check whether a future was cancelled
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cthreadpool.h>

bool cthrpool_future_cancelled(cthrpool_future *f);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns true if cthrpool_shutdown_immediate discarded the task of this
future before it could run. In that case cthrpool_future_get returns
NULL and cthrpool_future_done returns true.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
f   Future handle (NULL returns false)
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
true if the future was cancelled, false otherwise.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cthrpool_future_get (3),
.BR cthrpool_future_done (3),
.BR cthrpool_shutdown_immediate (3)
